# F-ENVELOPE — Design Package Index

**Goal:** Freeze the universal node envelope schema + fixture corpus.
**Stage:** DESIGN (PLANNER). No implementation artifacts are produced here; this package is the
input contract for the IMPLEMENT stage.

| Document | Contains |
|---|---|
| [`design.md`](design.md) | Component graph, interfaces, data flow, lifecycle state machine, layering decisions |
| [`envelope-fields.md`](envelope-fields.md) | Field-by-field §4.2 envelope specification + JSON Schema encoding for each field |
| [`fixture-corpus.md`](fixture-corpus.md) | Valid/invalid fixture matrix (16 + 23), manifest format, coverage-test design |
| [`assumptions.md`](assumptions.md) | **PAEOS-6 assumption surfacing** — every unverifiable premise, its blast radius, and its falsifier |
